              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hag 2:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no dwonde oyengo piny, to i hongo ma pama go ociko ni, “Odoko abino yengo ki nyaka piny kende, to polo bende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac me ni, Odoko, nyutho maber n'ibino yengo gi ŋilo woko gigipiny m'ocwey, aka nyaka gigipiny ma kiyengere ama bino doŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
